  "prompt": "How many new contacts arrived in each month of 2025, and how many of them through a paid source? A contact is an email, and it is new in the month of its earliest lead (the one with the earliest created_at, over all the leads, not only those of 2025). created_at is Brussels local time; 2025 runs from 2025-01-01 00:00 up to but not including 2026-01-01 00:00, and the month is the first day of its month. When two leads of an email tie on created_at, the lower lead_id is kept, and its source counts. The paid sources are display, events, paid_search, paid_social and review_sites. Return three columns, in this order: first_month, new_contacts and paid_contacts. Return one row for each month of 2025 with a new contact. Any row order is fine.",
